, c'è una scommessa crudele che la riguarda direttamente."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dangerous Liaisons","overview":"The innocent Célène might be falling in love with popular surfer Tristan at her new school. But she has no idea that, in actuality, she’s the object of a cruel bet between Tristan and Instagram influencer Vanessa."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Du haut de ses 17 ans, Célène est idéaliste, croit en l’amour absolu, et s’intéresse davantage à la lecture qu’aux réseaux sociaux. En quittant Paris pour Biarritz, elle s'apprête à vivre pour quelques temps loin de son fiancé, Pierre. Très vite, elle se confronte à la diabolique élite de son nouveau lycée sur laquelle règnent l’ex star du grand écran et reine d'Instagram Vanessa et le célèbre surfeur Tristan, aussi dangereux que séduisant. Lorsqu'elle tombe amoureuse de lui, Célène est loin de se douter qu’elle est au centre d’un cruel pari entre Tristan et Vanessa. Jusqu’où iront-ils?","tagline":"Ils refont la story"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iIQ3To4WxteOZTKrCJVV0pQElFs.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bW62WOLYzax1WSG6tDTuJ5dBdT7.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":968739,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iIQ3To4WxteOZTKrCJVV0pQElFs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iIQ3To4WxteOZTKrCJVV0pQElFs.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iIQ3To4WxteOZTKrCJVV0pQElFs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iIQ3To4WxteOZTKrCJVV0pQElFs.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/opTwqTgREzvP67ERVrqt0ApXbeV.jpg","previewUrl":"